Work        <== `work` @Name `{` Field* @`}`
Name        <-- {[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*} SKIP
Field       <-- SKIP (Goal / Inputs / Outputs / Tools / Memory /
                       Invariants / Workflow / Executors)

Goal        <== `goal` @`:` Text
Inputs      <== `inputs` @`:` List
Outputs     <== `outputs` @`:` List
Tools       <== `tools` @`:` List
Memory      <== `memory` @`:` Text
Invariants  <== `invariants` @`:` List
Workflow    <== `workflow` @`:` `[` StepList @`]`
Executors   <== `executors` @`:` `{` ExecPair* @`}`

StepList    <-- Step (`->` @Step)*
Step        <-- {!`]` !`}` Name}
ExecPair    <-- SKIP Name @`:` ExecKind
ExecKind    <-- `code`->'code' / `rule`->'rule' / `ml`->'ml' / `slm`->'slm'

List        <-- `[` Item (`,` @Item)* @`]`
Item        <-- {~ (!`,` !`]` !LINEBREAK .)* ~}
Text        <-- {~ (!LINEBREAK .)* ~}
LINEBREAK   <-- %cn %cr? / %cr
SKIP        <-- (%s / LINEBREAK / `,`?)*

NAME_SUFFIX <-- [_%w]+
